WEBVTT

00:00:11.940 --> 00:00:13.000
The Ellarians?

00:00:13.370 --> 00:00:15.960
Nope, the Dogurians.

00:00:17.030 --> 00:00:19.950
Ever since this planet fell under Dogurian observation,

00:00:20.430 --> 00:00:22.790
things sure have gotten busy 'round here.

00:00:42.720 --> 00:00:44.020
Where is my brother?

00:00:44.020 --> 00:00:46.350
He left unexpectedly a few days ago,

00:00:46.350 --> 00:00:48.500
we have no way of predicting where he was headed.

00:00:48.500 --> 00:00:51.000
You know his personality, after all...

00:00:51.570 --> 00:00:53.030
Pursue him immediately.

00:00:53.030 --> 00:00:53.880
As you command.

00:00:58.150 --> 00:01:01.260
So this is his planet...

00:01:01.520 --> 00:01:06.480
Currently, hundreds of different alien species come and go, living their lives on the Earth.

00:01:06.480 --> 00:01:09.400
Species that come in peace, aggressive, warlike species...

00:01:09.400 --> 00:01:14.420
Aliens with all kinds of personalities live among us, maintaining a precarious balance.

00:01:14.920 --> 00:01:18.660
The only ones who don't realize this, are the Earthlings!

00:01:20.140 --> 00:01:20.940
Coming!

00:01:23.770 --> 00:01:24.910
Look who the cat dragged in!

00:01:24.910 --> 00:01:27.150
I'm being chased! Hide me!

00:01:27.510 --> 00:01:28.070
By who?

00:01:29.050 --> 00:01:30.980
My betrothed and my little brother.

00:01:36.250 --> 00:01:40.490
The towns entrance is adorned with a cow's skull

00:01:41.440 --> 00:01:44.840
It's fine that the law is decided by the strongest,

00:01:46.650 --> 00:01:50.410
But this simple feeling will not be enough to fulfill you

00:01:51.640 --> 00:01:56.060
Everyone will definitely revolt and shortly disappear

00:01:56.210 --> 00:02:01.190
That's a shocking bloody picture

00:02:01.190 --> 00:02:06.530
I'm feeling nauseous

00:02:06.530 --> 00:02:16.920
Holding my head, I board the subway

00:02:16.920 --> 00:02:27.090
Righteous way of living, righteous way of dying

00:02:27.090 --> 00:02:37.390
Who on earth knows or what the hell can show me?

00:02:44.840 --> 00:02:47.890
Cold finger girl

00:02:55.380 --> 00:02:57.010
Sit Down

00:03:06.920 --> 00:03:07.700
Please.

00:03:09.390 --> 00:03:12.870
The Second Prince of Planet Dogura, Mohan Ki Et Dogura.

00:03:12.870 --> 00:03:14.580
Straightforward and a straight arrow.

00:03:14.580 --> 00:03:16.220
The people trust him deeply,

00:03:16.220 --> 00:03:19.330
and he wields a different kind of power than I.

00:03:19.330 --> 00:03:24.600
Every Dogurian lives thinking "Wouldn't it be nice if he were our first prince?"

00:03:27.480 --> 00:03:31.240
The First Princess of Planet Magura, Luna Mi Mad Magura.

00:03:31.500 --> 00:03:36.700
She was chosen to marry me before she was even born, unfortunately.

00:03:36.700 --> 00:03:40.020
But she believes it to be a blessing,

00:03:40.020 --> 00:03:42.710
and instead of rebelling, tries to relish it.

00:03:43.220 --> 00:03:45.790
She's a creature I am unable to comprehend.

00:03:46.970 --> 00:03:51.300
They are both extremely conservative, exactly the types I can't stand.

00:03:51.720 --> 00:03:53.060
No kidding.

00:03:53.590 --> 00:03:55.400
And you've got more stuff?

00:03:55.400 --> 00:03:59.280
That's 'cause I was in the Koshien! Something like that's essential.

00:03:59.280 --> 00:04:00.530
And your coffee is still too strong.

00:04:00.530 --> 00:04:01.680
If you don't like it, get out.

00:04:01.970 --> 00:04:04.640
So, I'm using the same futon as before, then?

00:04:04.700 --> 00:04:06.220
Yeah.

00:04:06.130 --> 00:04:07.350
I see...

00:04:07.350 --> 00:04:08.020
Got a problem with that?

00:04:08.340 --> 00:04:10.360
Well, I <i>am</i> a prince, so...

00:04:10.540 --> 00:04:12.750
Then hurry up back to your planet, get married,

00:04:12.750 --> 00:04:14.540
and become a king or something, got it?

00:04:14.540 --> 00:04:16.410
A nice fluffy bed awaits you!

00:04:16.410 --> 00:04:17.400
I have no intention of doing so.

00:04:18.260 --> 00:04:24.040
That's exactly why I worked some magic behind the scenes and got the assembly to pass that bill.

00:04:24.550 --> 00:04:25.710
Bill?

00:04:26.200 --> 00:04:28.260
Those who are in line to the throne

00:04:28.260 --> 00:04:31.340
shall hold a wedding ceremony before they come of age.

00:04:31.790 --> 00:04:33.810
In the case that this requirement is unfulfilled,

00:04:33.810 --> 00:04:37.470
the right to the throne passes to the next prince in order.

00:04:38.070 --> 00:04:41.800
So the bill the prince passed hasn't been changed?

00:04:41.800 --> 00:04:44.510
The assembly voted down amending it.

00:04:45.070 --> 00:04:45.770
Why?

00:04:46.170 --> 00:04:50.060
Explain to me why the assembly would pass such a ridiculous bill in the first place!

00:04:50.060 --> 00:04:54.030
It's a deep, historical tradition that the first prince ascends to the throne on Planet Dogura!

00:04:54.620 --> 00:04:55.820
That's true...

00:04:56.030 --> 00:05:00.770
Yeah, but you know, all traditions change with the times, right?

00:05:01.120 --> 00:05:04.210
Changing it for this half-baked reason is not appropriate!

00:05:07.100 --> 00:05:10.030
Why is he the only man who doesn't understand

00:05:10.030 --> 00:05:12.960
why the assembly didn't want the prince ascending the throne?

00:05:13.510 --> 00:05:18.710
There's only one more month on this planet before my elder brother comes of age.

00:05:18.710 --> 00:05:20.970
If he doesn't undergo the marriage ceremony before then,

00:05:21.520 --> 00:05:24.230
the right to ascend the throne will fall to me!

00:05:24.450 --> 00:05:29.860
But, among the Dogurian people, there are those here and there who would prefer that.

00:05:30.250 --> 00:05:32.840
My role is nothing more than to assist the king!

00:05:32.840 --> 00:05:35.360
That is the position I live for!

00:05:35.360 --> 00:05:37.460
And Princess Luna, as well...

00:05:39.700 --> 00:05:42.400
I will find my brother, without fail!

00:05:42.400 --> 00:05:45.080
And I will force him to undergo the marriage ceremony!

00:05:48.370 --> 00:05:49.630
And there you have it.

00:05:51.410 --> 00:05:54.120
So, if you manage to run away, you win.

00:05:54.120 --> 00:05:58.560
But if you're caught and forced to marry, your brother and Princess Luna win.

00:05:59.300 --> 00:06:00.210
When did you...?

00:06:00.690 --> 00:06:02.170
That's correct.

00:06:02.170 --> 00:06:04.900
This time, Craft and the others are on my side.

00:06:05.450 --> 00:06:08.300
They should be slowing him down right about now, however...

00:06:08.640 --> 00:06:10.640
But you've got a whole month!

00:06:10.640 --> 00:06:11.900
I'll evade them, you'll see.

00:06:12.390 --> 00:06:15.510
I mean, honestly, he thinks he can catch <i>me</i>?

00:06:17.440 --> 00:06:18.320
<i>Me</i>?

00:06:19.330 --> 00:06:23.700
Why is it I feel like cheering on this brother of his I've never met...

00:06:24.630 --> 00:06:26.580
Is this all you have?

00:06:26.730 --> 00:06:28.020
Don't just open my cupboard!

00:06:28.020 --> 00:06:31.280
Ah, well. I'll wait, so go buy something for me.

00:06:31.880 --> 00:06:33.130
Come on. If you don't hurry,

00:06:33.470 --> 00:06:35.580
the limited-time sale at the Q-mart will be over...

00:06:35.760 --> 00:06:37.790
Who said I was goin', eh?

00:06:37.790 --> 00:06:39.180
Now, now...

00:06:40.000 --> 00:06:42.430
But, why is it you don't want to become King?

00:06:42.880 --> 00:06:45.420
Won't you be free to do anything if you do?

00:06:46.090 --> 00:06:49.550
Nothing of the sort. I'd be tied down by all kinds of things. It would just be a pain.

00:06:50.440 --> 00:06:54.420
In other words, I'm on the run to preserve my independence!

00:06:54.420 --> 00:06:56.220
Only one month left! With all my might, I shall—

00:06:56.220 --> 00:06:57.190
Brother!

00:07:02.060 --> 00:07:03.160
My little brother...

00:07:03.160 --> 00:07:04.030
What?!

00:07:04.750 --> 00:07:06.340
We will now begin the marriage ceremony

00:07:06.340 --> 00:07:08.660
between the two royal families of Planet Dogura and Planet Magura,

00:07:08.660 --> 00:07:11.750
Prince Baka Ki El Dogura, of Planet Dogura,

00:07:11.750 --> 00:07:15.800
and Princess Luna Mi Mad Magura, of Planet Magura!

00:07:19.000 --> 00:07:21.400
Siblings take after each other, I see...

00:07:21.400 --> 00:07:22.810
I take back everything I just said.

00:07:23.310 --> 00:07:25.510
I think some "flexibility" is in order...

00:07:25.510 --> 00:07:27.780
He's changed since I've seen him last.

00:07:27.780 --> 00:07:29.210
Is this the time to say something like that?

00:07:39.470 --> 00:07:40.580
Intense!

00:07:40.580 --> 00:07:44.570
Now, you will install your rings, and perform the ceremony!

00:07:45.170 --> 00:07:46.910
We'll begin with the bride!

00:07:47.410 --> 00:07:49.100
Before that, hand me the mic.

00:07:51.160 --> 00:07:54.210
How do you do, my beloved Prince...

00:07:55.040 --> 00:08:00.260
Ever since I can remember, I've been wishing for the day I could meet you.

00:08:00.820 --> 00:08:03.590
And today, now that I see you in person,

00:08:03.590 --> 00:08:05.840
What is she saying?

00:08:04.760 --> 00:08:08.560
my will grows even stronger.

00:08:05.840 --> 00:08:08.560
Something about the universe expanding, or whatever.

00:08:10.390 --> 00:08:13.190
I will become your wife.

00:08:15.960 --> 00:08:17.200
A ring?

00:08:17.200 --> 00:08:20.630
A special kind of bio-ring for royal use.

00:08:20.630 --> 00:08:22.050
Once you put it on...

00:08:24.050 --> 00:08:26.950
It becomes a part of your flesh, and can never be removed for your entire life.

00:08:27.010 --> 00:08:28.420
That's...

00:08:28.420 --> 00:08:31.470
To feel so deeply without ever actually meeting me...

00:08:31.470 --> 00:08:34.580
She could be considered a psycho, which is totally my type...

00:08:34.580 --> 00:08:36.630
You're sure thinking this through, ain't you?

00:08:36.630 --> 00:08:37.620
Now, brother!

00:08:38.090 --> 00:08:39.600
Install the ring!

00:08:39.600 --> 00:08:41.880
When you do, the marriage ceremony will be official!

00:08:42.450 --> 00:08:45.030
Now is the time to finally think about

00:08:45.030 --> 00:08:47.470
what's good for the people, and discard that childish selfishness!

00:08:47.970 --> 00:08:50.250
You've already had plenty of fun being free!

00:08:50.640 --> 00:08:51.600
You're kidding!

00:08:51.600 --> 00:08:53.340
My fun has only yet begun!

00:08:53.340 --> 00:08:55.660
There's only two more years before

00:08:55.660 --> 00:08:58.470
I can see my hilarious Great Earth Remodeling Plan come to fruition!

00:08:56.160 --> 00:08:59.470
I don't know what he's saying, but I do know that you're in the wrong here!

00:09:03.000 --> 00:09:04.280
Yukitaka-kun!

00:09:04.480 --> 00:09:05.390
That was fast!

00:09:05.390 --> 00:09:06.240
Brother!

00:09:18.040 --> 00:09:19.740
That was faster than I thought.

00:09:19.990 --> 00:09:23.420
Yes. He headed straight for that apartment when he left the house.

00:09:23.760 --> 00:09:26.840
Did the records of my earlier actions leak out?

00:09:26.840 --> 00:09:28.640
Where are Mohan's bodyguards?

00:09:29.010 --> 00:09:31.620
They don't seem to be operating with him.

00:09:31.620 --> 00:09:32.890
It's just the two of them?

00:09:33.720 --> 00:09:37.270
Perhaps they were hoping to allow you to chat in peace?

00:09:39.330 --> 00:09:44.570
<i>If Mohan isn't using his bodyguards, then there must be a reason.</i>

00:09:45.360 --> 00:09:47.120
I wonder what he's thinking?

00:09:47.120 --> 00:09:48.260
Hell if I know!

00:09:48.260 --> 00:09:51.060
All I know is I have a <i>bad</i> feeling about this!

00:09:58.700 --> 00:10:00.040
Oh, excuse me...

00:10:00.480 --> 00:10:01.400
I'll clean that up—

00:10:01.400 --> 00:10:03.200
Ah, it's okay.

00:10:04.480 --> 00:10:07.680
He drank out of this, yes? I can sense it.

00:10:08.650 --> 00:10:10.730
It's still a little warm.

00:10:10.730 --> 00:10:12.310
I can feel like I'm close to him.

00:10:12.990 --> 00:10:15.220
Your Japanese is quite good.

00:10:15.990 --> 00:10:20.900
I knew it was a local language which he enjoys, so I studied it as hard as I could.

00:10:21.380 --> 00:10:22.650
He?

00:10:22.650 --> 00:10:25.900
B... I mean, the prince.

00:10:27.650 --> 00:10:29.410
Sorry to make you wait. It's my daily routine.

00:10:30.090 --> 00:10:32.530
It's like night and day between those two.

00:10:32.530 --> 00:10:33.280
Yeah...

00:10:33.830 --> 00:10:35.070
Yukitaka-san...

00:10:36.080 --> 00:10:37.910
How do you know my name?

00:10:37.910 --> 00:10:40.030
I did background research.

00:10:40.800 --> 00:10:45.250
About what he's been doing here since he came to Earth.

00:10:45.640 --> 00:10:47.300
I-I see...

00:10:47.830 --> 00:10:49.650
I have a favor to ask.

00:10:49.650 --> 00:10:53.290
If it's not too much to ask, may we stay the night here?

00:10:53.840 --> 00:10:56.300
But, Princess... What about my brother?

00:10:56.850 --> 00:11:02.940
You should know well that he is not one to be easily caught if chased, Prince Mohan.

00:11:03.570 --> 00:11:07.200
I think it best to wait until he returns here.

00:11:07.200 --> 00:11:11.690
But I live by myself, so having a princess stay here is a little...

00:11:11.690 --> 00:11:13.370
Then I will stay here as well!

00:11:13.590 --> 00:11:14.190
Huh?

00:11:14.980 --> 00:11:16.910
Then there won't be a problem.

00:11:16.910 --> 00:11:19.330
Do not worry, we won't be any trouble.

00:11:19.810 --> 00:11:21.330
No trouble, he says?

00:11:21.330 --> 00:11:24.100
Doesn't look like they'll take no for an answer.

00:11:24.100 --> 00:11:25.460
I take back everything I said.

00:11:26.120 --> 00:11:28.870
I think these brothers might be more alike than they seem.

00:11:38.000 --> 00:11:39.990
Princess, huh?

00:11:39.990 --> 00:11:43.230
Um, what does he do, normally?

00:11:43.540 --> 00:11:48.900
Hmm, let me see... he reads books, and tries to piss me off...

00:11:48.900 --> 00:11:51.500
Oh, and he watches TV a lot.

00:11:51.500 --> 00:11:52.450
TV?

00:11:52.780 --> 00:11:56.330
One and a half years ago, there was a great deal of commotion in this area about a UFO,

00:11:56.710 --> 00:11:57.570
and the citizens—

00:11:59.700 --> 00:12:00.700
That's...

00:12:06.090 --> 00:12:08.630
<i>What the hell are they looking at, I wonder?</i>

00:12:09.800 --> 00:12:13.760
It's true that once I tried analyzing just as you instructed,

00:12:13.760 --> 00:12:15.390
I was able to see its actual form.

00:12:15.660 --> 00:12:19.470
You sure about this? If you're caught, this is a violation of galactic regulations...

00:12:19.470 --> 00:12:22.000
That's what I have you here for!

00:12:22.000 --> 00:12:22.880
Good luck with that!

00:12:23.860 --> 00:12:27.530
Keep control! Otherwise, he'll become the King soon!

00:12:27.530 --> 00:12:28.520
I know that!

00:12:28.990 --> 00:12:31.240
And, that area we talked about?

00:12:31.240 --> 00:12:31.780
Right...

00:12:35.370 --> 00:12:39.700
Prince, it seems like Prince Mohan hasn't noticed the escape pod yet.

00:12:39.700 --> 00:12:40.620
You must go quickly!

00:12:41.130 --> 00:12:41.990
Boring.

00:12:42.570 --> 00:12:44.140
He should have realized,

00:12:44.140 --> 00:12:49.250
me escaping out into space makes catching me within one month more difficult.

00:12:49.800 --> 00:12:50.780
Definitely...

00:12:50.780 --> 00:12:54.100
But Prince Mohan is very single-minded...

00:12:54.100 --> 00:12:56.940
It's not like him to come up with complex counter-measures.

00:12:56.940 --> 00:12:58.600
Even so, it's too clumsy.

00:12:58.910 --> 00:13:02.710
He's not using his bodyguards, and making no attempt to block my escape routes.

00:13:04.900 --> 00:13:06.020
Did you think of something?

00:13:07.400 --> 00:13:08.800
He couldn't be...

00:13:24.690 --> 00:13:25.590
Huh?

00:13:26.580 --> 00:13:27.880
Princess?

00:13:31.410 --> 00:13:33.360
Did she go out somewhere?

00:13:41.360 --> 00:13:42.960
These fit perfectly.

00:13:43.710 --> 00:13:46.610
Thank you, Miho-san.

00:13:49.940 --> 00:13:52.020
I'm sorry, did I wake you?

00:13:52.020 --> 00:13:54.650
No, I'm sorry, I'm sorry! It wasn't on purpose!

00:13:54.650 --> 00:13:56.580
This was just... an accident!

00:13:57.170 --> 00:13:58.870
S-Stay in there for a second!

00:13:58.870 --> 00:14:01.760
I didn't see anything! I didn't really see anything!

00:14:04.340 --> 00:14:05.640
Good morning.

00:14:05.990 --> 00:14:06.990
Huh?

00:14:06.990 --> 00:14:10.990
I borrowed a change of clothes from Miho-san's place.

00:14:10.990 --> 00:14:11.970
Huh?

00:14:12.320 --> 00:14:14.400
Should I not have taken a shower?

00:14:16.110 --> 00:14:17.070
It's cool.

00:14:20.800 --> 00:14:22.450
I wonder what he's looking at?

00:14:22.870 --> 00:14:24.660
Hell if I know.

00:14:24.880 --> 00:14:27.820
For Pete's sake, making us bring him out here...

00:14:27.820 --> 00:14:29.250
Just as I thought.

00:14:31.590 --> 00:14:33.480
Something flying by?

00:14:33.480 --> 00:14:34.340
No...

00:14:34.340 --> 00:14:36.540
The clouds are the same shape

00:14:36.540 --> 00:14:37.420
as yesterday.

00:14:38.130 --> 00:14:38.930
You don't mean...

00:14:39.260 --> 00:14:45.420
There's probably a barrier erected by some wormhole or something, and this is a false projection.

00:14:45.690 --> 00:14:46.520
But that's...

00:14:46.520 --> 00:14:47.230
You're joking!

00:14:47.550 --> 00:14:51.120
If that's true, there should be variances in the fluctuation frequency of space-time!

00:14:51.120 --> 00:14:52.730
It'd be noticed immediately!

00:14:52.730 --> 00:14:55.230
Even if the entire planet is covered?

00:14:56.000 --> 00:14:57.850
It's possible it wouldn't be noticed.

00:14:57.850 --> 00:15:00.660
You really think the princess would agree to something so drastic?

00:15:01.160 --> 00:15:02.590
I don't know.

00:15:02.590 --> 00:15:07.660
But, I do know that there is something out there beyond this walled off sky.

00:15:16.660 --> 00:15:18.160
What's that?

00:15:18.160 --> 00:15:19.960
Probably not just here...

00:15:20.610 --> 00:15:27.230
Thousands... no, tens of thousands of vessels can be assumed to be surrounding this planet.

00:15:27.860 --> 00:15:28.910
But, why?

00:15:28.910 --> 00:15:30.080
Who knows?

00:15:30.080 --> 00:15:33.650
But it's only natural to assume someone called them here.

00:15:34.140 --> 00:15:36.960
Why haven't the people on this planet noticed?

00:15:36.960 --> 00:15:41.340
Even if you create a barrier, many countries use artificial satellites and—

00:15:41.340 --> 00:15:45.020
It's a trivial matter to emulate the circuitry on those satellites.

00:15:45.470 --> 00:15:48.130
And the society on this planet is at the level

00:15:48.130 --> 00:15:52.000
where they only posses a small number of ships that can go into space.

00:15:52.000 --> 00:15:53.460
It would be trivial to manipulate them.

00:15:53.460 --> 00:15:54.380
Yes.

00:15:54.640 --> 00:16:00.070
The question is: Who is behind all this, and what are they after?

00:16:00.070 --> 00:16:01.130
Prince Mohan?

00:16:01.840 --> 00:16:04.670
It's true that this would make Mohan's job easier.

00:16:04.670 --> 00:16:08.150
This seals me here on Earth, after all.

00:16:08.150 --> 00:16:11.670
But, if that was his goal, there are other ways.

00:16:11.670 --> 00:16:13.310
I called them here!

00:16:15.050 --> 00:16:16.980
As guests for the wedding!

00:16:18.280 --> 00:16:19.150
Prince Mohan!

00:16:19.750 --> 00:16:23.160
I knew you were working for my brother from the start.

00:16:23.420 --> 00:16:26.240
Uh, er... That's not really true...

00:16:26.240 --> 00:16:28.150
We're just thinking of what's best for Planet Dogura, so—

00:16:28.150 --> 00:16:28.950
Don't worry.

00:16:30.080 --> 00:16:31.710
I don't intend to make an issue out of it.

00:16:32.380 --> 00:16:35.410
You are my brother's bodyguards, after all.

00:16:35.410 --> 00:16:36.980
Really?

00:16:36.980 --> 00:16:38.460
We can always count on you, Prince Mohan!

00:16:43.010 --> 00:16:46.600
Princess Luna is waiting for you, brother.

00:16:47.200 --> 00:16:49.620
Even if I skip out?

00:16:50.220 --> 00:16:51.350
I don't know.

00:16:52.170 --> 00:16:54.410
But, she believes you will come.

00:16:55.040 --> 00:16:59.480
She thinks that highly of you, brother, and so I summoned these guests.

00:17:00.070 --> 00:17:05.680
The princess intends to wait for you, but if it comes to it, I will use force.

00:17:05.680 --> 00:17:07.240
Please understand my intention.

00:17:08.230 --> 00:17:09.490
Say, Mohan...

00:17:10.790 --> 00:17:12.750
Do you love her?

00:17:17.000 --> 00:17:21.260
Planet Dogura and Planet Magura are similar to the Earth and its moon.

00:17:21.860 --> 00:17:24.300
Planet Magura orbits Planet Dogura.

00:17:24.970 --> 00:17:26.050
It does?

00:17:26.310 --> 00:17:29.940
Then that makes you Princess Kaguya, Luna-san!

00:17:29.940 --> 00:17:31.270
Princess Kaguya?

00:17:31.550 --> 00:17:33.770
Uh, it's okay if you don't understand.

00:17:34.060 --> 00:17:37.360
Originally, Magura wanted to be independent of Dogura,

00:17:37.360 --> 00:17:39.970
and there was a period fraught with many wars.

00:17:40.590 --> 00:17:45.730
Then, the first prince of Dogura and the first princess of Magura got married,

00:17:45.730 --> 00:17:48.650
which bound the two planets together in peace.

00:17:48.650 --> 00:17:49.660
Safe!

00:17:50.060 --> 00:17:53.300
So, basically, a marriage of convenience, huh?

00:17:53.300 --> 00:17:55.750
Are you okay with this?

00:17:55.750 --> 00:17:56.240
Yes.

00:17:57.520 --> 00:18:02.260
It was decided that we'd speak to each other over video once a month.

00:18:03.770 --> 00:18:07.290
When we were babies, of course, but as long as I remember,

00:18:07.290 --> 00:18:11.250
I never understood anything about him, even his voice.

00:18:12.900 --> 00:18:15.130
He never spoke a word, you see.

00:18:17.260 --> 00:18:20.980
Nevertheless, I heard that he possessed a genius intellect,

00:18:20.980 --> 00:18:25.390
and so to be a worthy partner, I studied as hard as I could.

00:18:26.380 --> 00:18:29.860
When I solved a difficult problem, the prince showed interest.

00:18:30.660 --> 00:18:34.830
He then thought of a different solution, and showed it to me.

00:18:35.800 --> 00:18:38.740
This back-and-forth continued for a number of years, and then one day...

00:18:38.740 --> 00:18:40.750
Not bad.

00:18:44.920 --> 00:18:48.800
That was the first time I heard his voice.

00:18:49.330 --> 00:18:51.250
That sounds like him, all right.

00:18:51.250 --> 00:18:53.310
I thought then,

00:18:53.890 --> 00:18:56.620
that I'd like to spend the rest of my life with him.

00:18:57.420 --> 00:19:01.630
Of course, I know about all the various rumors.

00:19:01.630 --> 00:19:05.780
Like how he has the worst personality in the universe, or how he's some devilspawn,

00:19:06.520 --> 00:19:09.180
or how he is secretly plotting the destruction of the galaxy...

00:19:09.180 --> 00:19:11.230
If you know all that, why...?

00:19:11.880 --> 00:19:15.120
I'd never be bored being with someone like him!

00:19:18.290 --> 00:19:20.390
B-Beautiful...

00:19:20.390 --> 00:19:22.540
Yukitaka, yer up!

00:19:22.700 --> 00:19:23.940
R-Right!

00:19:24.440 --> 00:19:25.670
Later!

00:19:26.440 --> 00:19:28.240
This is an interesting competition.

00:19:29.350 --> 00:19:31.050
Oh, you mean baseball.

00:19:35.760 --> 00:19:37.920
Eijiri! How about you hold back?

00:19:37.920 --> 00:19:39.640
We don't want the lady gettin' hurt now!

00:19:40.030 --> 00:19:44.230
Heh. "Hold back" isn't in my dictionary, see!

00:19:48.190 --> 00:19:49.320
No way...

00:19:54.380 --> 00:19:55.990
I want me one of her.

00:19:56.630 --> 00:19:58.040
She saw through it?

00:19:58.770 --> 00:20:01.040
Well, I was observing her.

00:20:02.970 --> 00:20:07.460
It looks like she knew. She said to give this to you.

00:20:08.960 --> 00:20:11.720
She doesn't seem like just your normal princess.

00:20:12.780 --> 00:20:14.130
What do you mean?

00:20:14.130 --> 00:20:18.780
Putting Mohan aside, she's chasing after you because she really loves you!

00:20:18.780 --> 00:20:19.810
How do you know?

00:20:20.070 --> 00:20:23.910
We asked her why she loves you!

00:20:23.910 --> 00:20:29.780
She might be a little... off. But her feelings are true, definitely!

00:20:30.200 --> 00:20:33.360
I don't know about Dogura and Magura and all that,

00:20:33.360 --> 00:20:36.070
but I think she's wasted on you, personally.

00:20:36.070 --> 00:20:39.760
Oh? Have you fallen for her too, Yukitaka?

00:20:39.350 --> 00:20:40.360
N-Not at all!

00:20:40.540 --> 00:20:42.420
You cheater, you.

00:20:42.420 --> 00:20:45.200
When you first met her wasn't it like "zing"!

00:20:45.410 --> 00:20:48.380
You go any further and I'll punch you off this balcony!

00:20:49.010 --> 00:20:50.420
Been there, done that.

00:20:50.860 --> 00:20:51.880
Whatever.

00:20:51.880 --> 00:20:55.220
What's true is that they know what we're doing, somehow.

00:20:56.050 --> 00:20:58.370
Their actions are too precisely targeted.

00:21:01.470 --> 00:21:02.260
What is it?

00:21:07.610 --> 00:21:09.020
Lend me a screwdriver.

00:21:09.770 --> 00:21:10.560
No way...

00:21:10.560 --> 00:21:14.490
Looks like they were spying on us, to learn of our movements.

00:21:14.990 --> 00:21:17.720
That princess set these up?

00:21:17.720 --> 00:21:20.300
Considering the condition they're in, these are from before that...

00:21:20.300 --> 00:21:22.980
Around when we came to the Earth, I'd say.

00:21:22.980 --> 00:21:25.010
Who would do it? And when?

00:21:25.610 --> 00:21:26.380
Oh, yeah...

00:21:28.190 --> 00:21:29.630
This thing again?

00:21:29.630 --> 00:21:33.020
It should show on the hidden camera I used back then.

00:21:34.340 --> 00:21:37.210
It looks like he's living together with some Earthling.

00:21:41.230 --> 00:21:43.310
That's definitely near the plug...

00:21:43.640 --> 00:21:45.240
Wait, then...

00:21:47.360 --> 00:21:48.150
Colin?

00:21:48.540 --> 00:21:51.590
He headed out to the backyard, saying he wanted to check it out, yes—

00:21:51.590 --> 00:21:52.370
It's here!

00:21:54.360 --> 00:21:56.180
Found it! There's a listening device.

00:21:56.180 --> 00:21:57.680
But, who would...

00:21:58.720 --> 00:22:00.120
What's the matter? Get off of me already!

00:22:00.830 --> 00:22:03.890
This is... beautiful.

00:22:04.380 --> 00:22:05.640
What do you think?

00:22:05.640 --> 00:22:07.560
Colin is definitely the spy.

00:22:07.940 --> 00:22:10.840
I suspect he's already returned to her side.

00:22:10.840 --> 00:22:13.040
Then, that means...

00:22:26.610 --> 00:22:27.350
Are you ready?

00:22:27.640 --> 00:22:38.150
Do not fear 'The Now' searching for something that can't be seen across this infinite distance

00:22:38.150 --> 00:22:52.370
Under the hundred million glittering lights, I found you searching for your dream

00:22:52.370 --> 00:23:01.130
An infinite world filled with glass shards

00:23:02.300 --> 00:23:13.190
Growing up I felt I knew many meaningless things

00:23:13.190 --> 00:23:20.650
Shining like a jewel, you soar in the sky, no past, no future

00:23:20.650 --> 00:23:25.990
The answer is beyond the sky

00:23:25.990 --> 00:23:36.500
Do not fear 'The Dream', in a distant
place where truth and lies are unseen

00:23:36.500 --> 00:23:52.230
Under the hundred million glittering lights, flowers sway in the wind

00:23:57.790 --> 00:23:59.860
C-Captain!

00:23:59.860 --> 00:24:02.830
We can't even contact the mothership, let alone Planet Dogura.

00:24:02.830 --> 00:24:04.870
So this is how Earth looks now?

00:24:04.870 --> 00:24:07.470
I'm sorry. Don't think ill of me.

00:24:07.470 --> 00:24:08.540
That's playing dirty!

00:24:08.540 --> 00:24:09.550
What's your plan?

00:24:09.550 --> 00:24:12.490
You guys are conspiring with that Baka again, ain't you?

00:24:12.490 --> 00:24:16.380
Hey, Prince Baka! You think this is a place to take a stroll?!

00:24:16.380 --> 00:24:19.040
Next time: Full moon...!

00:24:19.040 --> 00:24:20.990
You rock, seriously.
